 description

Instance table (memory map, IP ids/versions, IRQ lines and shared
vectors, PAC/GCLK/DMAC ids, pad/signal table) and the default NVM-rows
image (production user row, calibration row, serial number), generated
by Peripheral Pretender's generator/atdf2qemu.py from the PIC32CM-JH DFP
1.3.221 ATDF. Regenerate rather than edit by hand.

Peripheral Pretender downstream patch; not for upstream submission.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
